          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ mavindya ki, na matyaamũsũngĩa ndeto; nũndũ mwĩao wa mũsumbĩ waĩtye, Mũtikamũsũngĩe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ Eliakimu mwana wa Ilikia, ũla waĩ mũsyaĩĩsya wa andũ ma nyũmba, na mũandĩki Sevina, na Yoa, mwana wa Asavu, mũandĩki wa maũndũ, mathi kwa Esekia matembũangĩte ngũa syoo, na mamũtavya ndeto sya Lavi‐sake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.22"
            ]
          }
